## Layer Types & Use Cases

### Fill Layer
Polygons with solid color or pattern fills.

```typescript
{
  "type": "fill",
  "paint": {
    "fill-color": "#3bb2d0",
    "fill-opacity": 0.8
  }
}
```

### Line Layer
Styled linestrings for roads, boundaries, contours.

```typescript
{
  "type": "line",
  "paint": {
    "line-color": "#000",
    "line-width": 2
  }
}
```

### Symbol Layer
Text labels and icon markers.

```typescript
{
  "type": "symbol",
  "layout": {
    "text-field": ["get", "name"],
    "text-font": ["Open Sans Regular"],
    "icon-image": "marker-15"
  }
}
```

### Circle Layer
Scaled or interactive point data visualization.

```typescript
{
  "type": "circle",
  "paint": {
    "circle-radius": 5,
    "circle-color": "#ff0000"
  }
}
```

### Fill-Extrusion Layer
3D polygon extrusion (buildings, terrain features).

```typescript
{
  "type": "fill-extrusion",
  "paint": {
    "fill-extrusion-height": ["get", "height"],
    "fill-extrusion-color": "#aaa"
  }
}
```

### Heatmap Layer
Density visualization for point clusters.

```typescript
{
  "type": "heatmap",
  "paint": {
    "heatmap-weight": 1,
    "heatmap-radius": 30
  }
}
```

