## Advanced Style Features

### Imports
Compose styles from other styles (imported styles become base layers).

```json
{
  "version": 8,
  "imports": [
    {
      "id": "basemap",
      "url": "mapbox://styles/mapbox/standard",
      "config": {
        "showPointOfInterestLabels": false,
        "showTransitLabels": false
      }
    }
  ],
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "custom-layer",
      "type": "circle",
      "source": "custom-data"
    }
  ]
}
```

### Schema (Configuration Properties)
Define configurable properties for styles using `schema`.

```json
{
  "schema": {
    "showLabels": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": true,
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Toggle label visibility"
      }
    },
    "primaryColor": {
      "type": "color",
      "default": "#3bb2d0"
    }
  }
}
```

### Slots
Placeholder layers for custom layer insertion in imported styles.

```json
{
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "custom-markers",
      "type": "symbol",
      "slot": "middle",
      "source": "markers"
    }
  ]
}
```

**Standard slots:** `bottom`, `middle`, `top`

### Appearances
Conditional visual styling sets for layers.

```json
{
  "id": "buildings",
  "type": "fill-extrusion",
  "appearances": [
    {
      "id": "night-mode",
      "condition": ["==", ["config", "theme"], "dark"],
      "paint": {
        "fill-extrusion-color": "#333"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

### Weather Effects

**Fog:**
```json
{
  "fog": {
    "range": [0.5, 10],
    "color": "#ffffff",
    "horizon-blend": 0.1,
    "star-intensity": 0.15
  }
}
```

**Rain:**
```json
{
  "rain": {
    "intensity": 0.8,
    "opacity": 0.6
  }
}
```

**Snow:**
```json
{
  "snow": {
    "intensity": 0.7,
    "vignette": 0.5
  }
}
```

