## Performance Considerations

### Tileset Optimization
- Use vector tiles for scalable, styleable data
- Raster tiles for imagery or pre-rendered layers
- Simplify geometries at low zoom levels
- Monitor tile size graph in tileset explorer

### Style Optimization
- Minimize source count (15 limit)
- Use filters to create multiple layers from one source
- Composite sources when possible
- Limit symbol density at high zoom levels

### Runtime Optimization
- Load styles asynchronously
- Use clustering for dense point data
- Debounce user interactions
- Implement viewport-based data loading

---

## Attribution & Print Policy

**Web/Mobile Attribution:** Required for all Mapbox maps.

**Print Maps:** Require appropriate Mapbox attribution. See Mapbox print policy before exporting images.

---

## Success Metrics

- ✅ Datasets exported to tilesets before styling
- ✅ Styles conform to Mapbox Style Specification v8
- ✅ Source count ≤ 15 per style
- ✅ Component-based styling used where possible
- ✅ Expressions used instead of legacy function syntax
- ✅ Imports configured with schema properties when available
- ✅ Proper attribution included in all maps
- ✅ Print policy followed for exported images

